 still an  egomaniac and has not grown up but now  that he's grown she's finally got to  tell will what he'd done and how it made  her feel which left him regret filled  with tears in his eyes but i felt it was  necessary for us to finally  move forward  yeah  number eight these two were just fated  to fight in the fate of the furious  dwayne johnson thinks vin diesel didn't  act very professionally on set johnson  and diesel have fundamental differences  in philosophies on how they approach  movie making and collaborating still  love each other that's my boy number  nine sometimes opposites attract the  worst oscars hosting in the world was  done by anne hathaway and james franco  we're both nominated  uh  actually james i'm not nominated tonight  come on anne don't be so modest hathaway  originally turned the gig down but  franco convinced her to do it their  complete opposite personality types made  them clash on stage she came prepared he  did not it used to be  you get naked you get nominated  she did liken herself to a slightly  manic cheerleader so it isn't all  franco's fault but well after it was  over she was thinking you gotta be  kidding me your first instinct is  usually the right one all the reasons  she initially turned the role down came  true and franco doesn't seem to like  anne hathaway because she's too  scripted number 10 while they were  inseparable confidants in the city  offset that was not the case the end  just like that revival of sex in the  city was pretty much a recycled version  of the third film that never got done a  film that kim cattrall turned down in  2016 because she found the script wasn't  very good there was nothing of interest  for her character kim wasn't asked to be  part of the show and she is more than  fine with that after being so open with  her feelings in the past about sarah  jessica parker she criticized parker on  social media for showing fake sympathy  when someone she'd cared about passed  away an attempt to use this moment to  repair her image i don't know i found it  very upsetting number 11. the whole  universe was in a hot dense state thanks  to these two the big bang theory stars  kaylee cuoco and johnny galecki dated  for a bit but kaylee was quick to move  on from johnny to a new equestrian bow  and didn't shy away from bringing him to  set or making this relationship well  known this created a rift in kaley and  johnny's work relationship number 12.  turns out growing up in st thomas  ontario doesn't mean you'll get along  great on set ryan gosling was the one in  charge of casting his love interest and  he just found he had absolutely no  chemistry with rachel mcadams and he  made a fool of her in her audition in  front of her face about them having no  chemistry this behavior persisted on set  then one day the two dated they're gonna  look really bad at the end of this this  isn't gonna turn out well for us number  13 there was a stark conflict between  these two terence howard vouched for rdj  to get the role of iron man and that was  an uphill battle given they weren't  willing to look past robert's addiction  howard even took a one million dollar  pay cut to get his friend in the door  but when terence fell on hard times rdj  wasn't there to back him up so terence  blames rdj for why he's no longer  involved in the mcu i think they could  have a huge franchise off of it but  number 14. the communication between  these two was a wasteland tom hardy and  charlize theron didn't get along while  filming mad max fury road because they  were stuck together filming in a vehicle  that was going to no particular  destination the tight quarters made  filming super uncomfortable and fighting  inevitable theron said it was like a  family road trip that just never went  anywhere number 15. the sparknotes  version of star-crossed lovers in romeo  and juliet claire danes was the serious  one and her co-star leonardo dicaprio  liked to mess around but that doesn't  mean they 